 filled with challenging obstacles. Each floor presents new complex puzzles that require close communication and flawless cooperation between the two players. Be creative, solve twisted riddles, and use your wits to progress.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/4f0485840c8cfc8d27eb6d15de77e722.poster.avif?t=1720880933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/4f0485840c8cfc8d27eb6d15de77e722.webm?t=1720880933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/4f0485840c8cfc8d27eb6d15de77e722.mp4?t=1720880933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/be07aebd9e3530261283fed8c281d1dc.webp?t=1720880933\" /></span> The narrator will follow your progress in the tower, so be prepared for sharp comments and witty remarks that spice up your interactions with the game.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/fe46dc0859b131148a849f60d6a2c1da.poster.avif?t=1720880933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/fe46dc0859b131148a849f60d6a2c1da.webm?t=1720880933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/fe46dc0859b131148a849f60d6a2c1da.mp4?t=1720880933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/be07aebd9e3530261283fed8c281d1dc.webp?t=1720880933\" /></span> Your ultimate goal is to climb the tower's floors, solve all the complex puzzles, and reach the heart of the spatio-temporal rift. Only skillful puzzle-solving will allow you to restore order in the universe and mend the tears of time.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/d19296445dd772251a66556fa81cbd40.poster.avif?t=1720880933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/d19296445dd772251a66556fa81cbd40.webm?t=1720880933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/d19296445dd772251a66556fa81cbd40.mp4?t=1720880933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/be07aebd9e3530261283fed8c281d1dc.webp?t=1720880933\" /></span> Will you succeed in solving puzzles to repair the rift that threatens time?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/be07aebd9e3530261283fed8c281d1dc.webp?t=1720880933\" /></span> What are these rifts really?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2448830/extras/be07aebd9e3530261283fed8c281d1dc.webp?t=1720880933\" /></span> What is the narrator's purpose and who is he?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Answer these questions through the different trials you will encounter!</h2>",
